    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nProviding an excellent refurbishment opportunity, this 6 bedroom, 3 bathroom three storey double fronted property is prominently located on New Street in the market town of Abbeyfeale. \n\nExtending to 130 sqm/ 1399 sq ft approx., it offers a rare opportunity to acquire a versatile property with excellent scope for commercial or residential use. The property benefits from high visibility, strong footfall and easy access to all local amenities, making it an ideal choice for business owners, investors or those seeking a refurbishment project.\n\nA spacious and private enclosed yard is accessible via laneway to rear. The site extends to a large green area (as pictured) which is ideal for further building subject to PP / leisure space and benefits from vehicular access. The property has the benefit of connections to all essential public services.\n\nHaving been vacant for over two years, the property may qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant.\n\nViewing is recommended and is strictly by appointment only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch - 1.53m x 1.39m\nwith tile flooring and pvc door\n\nEntrance Hallway - 2.86m x 1.99m\nwith linoleum flooring\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 3.04m x 2.30m\nfitted units, cooker, glazed panels (x 3), lino flooring & window\n\nOff Kitchen - 2.12m x 1.82m\nwith fitted units, linoleum flooring & window\n\nOff Kitchen - 1.88m x 1.24m\nwith linoleum flooring & door to rear\n\nW/C - 1.91m x 1.09m\nwith belfast sink fitted, whb, w/c & window\n\nLounge / Sitting Room - 3.30m x 3.11m\nwith electric stove, linoleum wooden effect flooring, internal glazed units (x3) & window\n\nLiving Room - 4.97m x 2.82m\nwith fitted units, linoleum wooden effect flooring & 2 windows\n\nHallway - 3.91m x 0.91m\nwith linoleum flooring\n\nLanding - 2.90m x 2.53m\nwith carpet flooring, storage undestairs unit\n\nHallway - 2.02m x 0.75m\nwith carpet flooring\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.24m x 2.84m\ndouble with whb, carpet flooring & window\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.07m x 3.23m\ndouble with fitted cupboard, whb, carpet flooring & 2 windows\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.87m x 2.50m\ndouble with carpet flooring & window\n\nFamily Bathroom - 2.06m x 1.82m\nwith Mira Elite pumped shower, lino flooring, wall tiles, whb, w/c & window\n\n2nd Floor - 3.28m x 1.86m\nwith wooden flooring & window\n\n2nd Floor - 3.25m x 2.46m\nwith carpet flooring & windows\n\n2nd floor - 2.04m x 1.85m\nwith carpet flooring & window\n\n2nd Floor - 3.26m x 2.62m\nwith carpet flooring & window\n\nW/C - 2.63m x 2.04m\nwith lino flooring, whb & w/c\n\n"
      },
